@501 = ~Potion of Extra Healing~
@502 = ~When completely consumed, this potion restores 18 hit points. The effect is instantaneous and the potion is destroyed in the process.~
@503 = ~Potion of Superior Healing~
@504 = ~When completely consumed, this potion restores 60 hit points. The effect is instantaneous and the potion is destroyed in the process.~
@505 = ~Potion of Hill Giant Strength*~
@506 = ~Anyone who drinks a Potion of Giant Strength gains superhuman Strength, along with bonuses to attack and damage rolls with melee and thrown weapons. The effects last for 10 turns.

STATISTICS:

Strength: 19
Duration: 10 turns

Weight: 1~

